'''Replica Leer Cast''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Festival Mask}}. It is the [[replica]] version of {{il|Leer Cast}}.

==Mechanics==
The {{stl|Mana Regeneration Aura}} from this item is additive to other increase/reduced mod, including the {{ml|ManaRegenerationUnique__14___|display=stat_text}} on this item. Assume it does not have other mods from other source, the net effect of this item is granting {{c|mod|30% increased Mana Regeneration Rate}} to allies, but the player character has {{c|mod|30% reduced Mana Regeneration Rate}}.

The buff is an aura, but it is not an aura skill, thus does not benefit from mod such as {{c|mod|#% increased effect of Non-Curse Auras from your Skills}}. The aura from the original item can stack with each other characters that use {{il|Leer Cast}}.<ref name=stack/> Thus, the {{stl|Mana Regeneration Aura}} may also able to stack with each other.{{guesswork}}

The other 3 mods are the same as the original.

